{"slug":"b-q-y","ar":"ب ق ي","total":21,"core":"remaining; lasting","forms":[{"ar":"أَبْقَىٰٓ","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":7,"gloss":"more lasting","word":null,"ex":{"s":87,"a":17,"p":3,"ar":["وَٱلْـَٔاخِرَةُ","خَيْرٌ","وَأَبْقَىٰٓ"],"en":"While the Hereafter is better and more enduring"}},{"ar":"بَقِىَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":3,"gloss":"to remain; to spare","word":null,"ex":{"s":53,"a":51,"p":3,"ar":["وَثَمُودَا۟","فَمَآ","أَبْقَىٰ"],"en":"And Thamud - and He did not spare [them]"}},{"ar":"بَقِيَّت","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"remnant, what remains","word":null,"ex":{"s":11,"a":86,"p":1,"ar":["بَقِيَّتُ","ٱللَّهِ","خَيْرٌ","لَّكُمْ","إِن","كُنتُم","مُّؤْمِنِينَ ۚ","وَمَآ","أَنَا۠","عَلَيْكُم","بِحَفِيظٍ"],"en":"What remains [lawful] from Allah is best for you, if you would be believers. But I am not a guardian over you"}},{"ar":"بَاقِيَة","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"remaining, lasting","word":null,"ex":{"s":69,"a":8,"p":5,"ar":["فَهَلْ","تَرَىٰ","لَهُم","مِّنۢ","بَاقِيَةٍ"],"en":"Then do you see of them any remains"}},{"ar":"بَاقِين","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"those remaining, survivors","word":null,"ex":{"s":26,"a":120,"p":4,"ar":["ثُمَّ","أَغْرَقْنَا","بَعْدُ","ٱلْبَاقِينَ"],"en":"Then We drowned thereafter the remaining ones"}},{"ar":"بَٰقِيَٰت","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"enduring things","word":null,"ex":{"s":18,"a":46,"p":6,"ar":["ٱلْمَالُ","وَٱلْبَنُونَ","زِينَةُ","ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","ٱلدُّنْيَا ۖ","وَٱلْبَـٰقِيَـٰتُ","ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتُ","خَيْرٌ","عِندَ","رَبِّكَ","ثَوَابًا","وَخَيْرٌ","أَمَلًا"],"en":"Wealth and children are [but] adornment of the worldly life. But the enduring good deeds are better to your Lord for reward and better for [one's] hope"}},{"ar":"بَاق","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"lasting, enduring","word":null,"ex":{"s":16,"a":96,"p":7,"ar":["مَا","عِندَكُمْ","يَنفَدُ ۖ","وَمَا","عِندَ","ٱللَّهِ","بَاقٍ ۗ","وَلَنَجْزِيَنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","صَبَرُوٓا۟","أَجْرَهُم","بِأَحْسَنِ","مَا","كَانُوا۟","يَعْمَلُونَ"],"en":"Whatever you have will end, but what Allah has is lasting. And We will surely give those who were patient their reward according to the best of what they used to do"}},{"ar":"تُبْقِى","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":1,"gloss":"to spare, leave remaining","word":null,"ex":{"s":74,"a":28,"p":2,"ar":["لَا","تُبْقِى","وَلَا","تَذَرُ"],"en":"It lets nothing remain and leaves nothing [unburned]"}}],"surahs":[[20,4],[2,2],[11,2],[16,1],[18,1],[19,1],[26,1],[28,1],[37,1],[42,1],[43,1],[53,1],[55,1],[69,1],[74,1],[87,1]]}